@host = http://localhost:5241

### Readiness - pings MongoDB. Run this first to confirm your connection string works.
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Liveness - process is up, does not touch the database.
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Create a book. Copy the "id" from the response into the requests below.
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Little Mongo Book",
  "author": "Karl Seguin",
  "pageCount": 60,
  "publishedOn": "2011-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "tags": [ "mongodb", "databases", "beginner" ],
  "publisherName": "Self published",
  "publisherCountry": "CA"
}

### List books, newest first.
GET {{host}}/books?skip=0&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Fetch one book.
@bookId = paste-an-id-here
GET {{host}}/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json

### Find books by tag - served by the multikey index on "tags".
GET {{host}}/books/by-tag/mongodb?limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Projection example - ids and titles only, no full documents over the wire.
GET {{host}}/books/titles?limit=100
Accept: application/json

### Validation failure - [ApiController] rejects this with 400 problem+json
### before any database call is made.
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "pageCount": -5,
  "publishedOn": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Aggregation: book and page counts grouped by author.
GET {{host}}/books/stats/by-author
Accept: application/json

### Replace a book in full.
PUT {{host}}/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Little Mongo Book (2nd edition)",
  "author": "Karl Seguin",
  "pageCount": 72,
  "publishedOn": "2012-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "tags": [ "mongodb", "databases" ]
}

### Partial update - sets a single field with $set.
PATCH {{host}}/books/{{bookId}}/page-count?pageCount=80

### Delete a book.
DELETE {{host}}/books/{{bookId}}

### OpenAPI document (development only).
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
